                                "kind": "text",
                                "value": "• Quadrant structure: Value is grouped into Capacity, Workforce, Revenue, and Quality. Each quadrant is an audit-ready slice — financial drivers carry $ math, qualitative drivers are tracked post-deployment as leading indicators.",
